cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "IRSounderLBL.jl: Line-by-line thermal infrared radiance simulation for nadir-viewing hyperspectral sounders"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for line-by-line simulation and optimal-estimation retrieval
  of thermal infrared spectra from nadir-viewing hyperspectral Fourier transform
  sounders (IASI, CrIS, IASI-NG, MTG-IRS), validated against ARTS and LBLRTM.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tony
    family-names: Vincent
    alias: tvince
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tvince/IRSounderLBL.jl"
keywords:
  - radiative-transfer
  - remote-sensing
  - infrared-sounder
  - HITRAN
  - optimal-estimation
  - atmospheric-science
  - julia
